**조치 필요 (1)**
- ❌ **AC3** expired coupons are rejected — No expiry comparison in coupon.ts <code>src/coupon.ts</code>

**P0 체크리스트 (1)**
- [ ] **TC-01** Apply a coupon one second before expiry → the discount is applied

<details><summary><b>TC-01 Apply a coupon one second before expiry</b> [P0 · AC3]</summary>

- **전제**: a coupon that expires in 1 second
- **데이터**: <code>coupon.expiresAt = now + 1s</code> · <code>order.subtotal = 30000</code>
- **단계**:
  1. the user applies it at checkout
- **기대**: the discount is applied
- **관련**: AC3: expired coupons are rejected · <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- **이유**: Boundary of the expiry rule.

</details>

<details><summary>P1 · P2 티켓 (2)</summary>

<details><summary><b>TC-02 Apply the same coupon twice in parallel</b> [P1 · AC1]</summary>

- **전제**:
  - a coupon that was never used
  - two checkout tabs for the same cart
- **데이터**: <code>coupon.expiresAt = now + 1s</code> · <code>order.subtotal = 30000</code>
- **단계**:
  1. both tabs apply the coupon at the same moment
- **기대**:
  - exactly one request succeeds
  - the other one gets a <code>COUPON&#95;ALREADY&#95;USED</code> error
- **관련**: AC1: a coupon can be applied once · <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- **이유**: Boundary of the expiry rule.
- **신뢰도**: 보통

</details>

<details><summary><b>TC-03 Checkout without a coupon still works</b> [P2]</summary>

- **전제**: a cart without a coupon
- **데이터**: <code>coupon.expiresAt = now + 1s</code> · <code>order.subtotal = 30000</code>
- **단계**:
  1. the user pays
- **기대**: the total is unchanged
- **신뢰도**: 낮음

</details>

</details>

<details><summary>요구사항별 판정 (2)</summary>

Adds coupon application to checkout.

| 요구사항 | 상태 | 근거 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| AC1: a coupon can be applied once | ✅ 충족 | CouponService.apply() checks usage <code>src/coupon.ts</code> |
| AC3: expired coupons are rejected | ❌ 누락 | No expiry comparison in coupon.ts <code>src/coupon.ts</code> |

</details>

### 리스크

- 🔴 **Missing expiry check** — AC3 not implemented <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- 🟡 **No audit log** — Coupon use is not logged.

### 가정

- Coupon codes are case-insensitive.

